; The exports of ntdll.dll (ReactOS 0.4.16, i386) that the native test
; programs call, for their import library (`cargo xtask` builds it with
; dlltool --kill-at). stdcall functions carry their argument bytes (@N); the
; DLL exports them undecorated.
LIBRARY ntdll.dll
EXPORTS
DbgPrint
NtClose@4
NtDeviceIoControlFile@40
NtOpenFile@24
NtQuerySystemInformation@16
NtShutdownSystem@4
NtTerminateProcess@8
RtlUnwind@16
NtCreateFile@44
NtReadFile@36
NtQueryInformationFile@20
NtQueryVolumeInformationFile@20
NtQueryDirectoryFile@44
NtWriteFile@36
NtCreateEvent@20
NtSetEvent@8
NtWaitForSingleObject@12
NtTerminateThread@8
RtlCreateUserThread@40
NtOpenKey@12
NtQueryValueKey@24
NtSetValueKey@24
NtFlushKey@4
NtQueryInformationProcess@20
NtQueryKey@20
NtQueryObject@20
